OL,3,CThe prime minister is on holiday, so
OL,4,Cwho is in charge?
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has gone away on holiday
OL,7,Ftwo weeks after entering Downing
OL,8,FStreet.
OL,10,FThe family break comes the day after
OL,11,Fthe prime minister announced changes
OL,12,Fto the prison early release scheme,
OL,13,Fwhich have been met with controversy,
OL,14,Fparticularly from victims and families
OL,15,Fof crimes like manslaughter and
OL,16,Fdomestic abuse.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
