CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785858502
OL,3,CThe prime minister is on holiday, so
OL,4,Cwho is in charge?
OL,6,FOfficials would not be drawn on where
OL,7,FBurnham, who is married with three
OL,8,Fchildren, is holidaying. However, it
OL,9,Fis understood to be abroad rather than
OL,10,Fin the UK.
OL,12,FWhile the PM is away, he will remain
OL,13,Fin contact with officials and has
OL,14,Finsisted the government will continue
OL,15,Fto function as normal.
OL,17,FBut given he has not appointed a
OL,18,Fdeputy prime minister, who is
OL,19,Ftechnically in charge during his
OL,20,Fabsence?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
