OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785858502
OL,3,CThe prime minister is on holiday, so
OL,4,Cwho is in charge?
OL,6,FNo Deputy PM?
OL,8,FBurnham bucked the traditional Labour
OL,9,Ftrend of appointing a deputy prime
OL,10,Fminister when he selected his cabinet
OL,11,Fin July, instead giving Louise Haigh
OL,12,Fthe title of First Secretary of State.
OL,14,FThe former transport secretary was
OL,15,Finstrumental in Burnham's campaign to
OL,16,Fbecome Labour leader and subsequently
OL,17,FPM.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
