OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785858502
OL,3,CThe prime minister is on holiday, so
OL,4,Cwho is in charge?
OL,6,FDubbed one of his team's "band of
OL,7,Fstrong Northern power women", Haigh's
OL,8,Frole serves a similar political
OL,9,Ffunction to a deputy prime minister,
OL,10,Fwith her title making her the most
OL,11,Fsenior secretary of state in the
OL,12,Fcabinet.
OL,14,FGeorge Osborne previously held the
OL,15,Frole under David Cameron; Damien Green
OL,16,Funder Theresa May; and Peter Mandelson
OL,17,Funder Gordon Brown.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/10
