OL,3,CThe prime minister is on holiday, so
OL,4,Cwho is in charge?
OL,6,FDeputy PMs do not have any automatic
OL,7,Frights or responsibilities but cover
OL,8,Ffor the leader at PMQs or elsewhere,
OL,9,Fas David Lammy or Angela Rayner did
OL,10,Ffor Sir Keir Starmer during his
OL,11,Fpremiership.
OL,13,FDominic Raab was deputy PM under Boris
OL,14,FJohnson and effectively deputised for
OL,15,Fthe then-prime minister when he was in
OL,16,Fhospital with Covid.
OL,18,FWatch ITV News Political Reporter
OL,19,FLewis Dennison explain who is in
OL,20,Fcharge while the PM is away
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/10
