OL,3,CThe prime minister is on holiday, so
OL,4,Cwho is in charge?
OL,6,FIs it too soon?
OL,8,FReform UK has taken to social media to
OL,9,Fcriticise the PM's decision to take a
OL,10,Fbreak, claiming "he's bunked off" from
OL,11,Fleading the country.
OL,13,FDeputy leader Richard Tice said: "Open
OL,14,Fborders part time Burnham. Britain is
OL,15,Fbroken. Britain is being invaded. Yet
OL,16,FBurnham disappears."
OL,18,FHis colleague and party chairman Lee
OL,19,FAnderson said: "Two weeks into the job
OL,20,Fand Andy Burnham has already had
OL,21,Fenough.
OL,26,@uD@bOUxD@TO]{D@POU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/10
