OL,3,CThe prime minister is on holiday, so
OL,4,Cwho is in charge?
OL,6,F"After dropping a number of unfunded
OL,7,Fcommitments and overseeing over 2,000
OL,8,Fillegal migrants breaking into our
OL,9,Fcountry, he's bunked off for a jolly
OL,10,Fabroad."
OL,12,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,13,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,14,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,15,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,17,FHowever, Conservative leader Kemi
OL,18,FBadenoch took a different approach.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/10
