OL,3,CThe prime minister is on holiday, so
OL,4,Cwho is in charge?
OL,6,FPrime ministers have often taken
OL,7,Fbreaks during the summer recess, when
OL,8,Fthey are not required in parliament,
OL,9,Fbut can be called back at a moment's
OL,10,Fnotice.
OL,12,FFormer PM Theresa May was known to
OL,13,Ftake walking holidays, and Tony Blair
OL,14,Fwas photographed on holiday in Italy
OL,15,Fwith his family just a few months into
OL,16,Fhis tenure.
OL,18,FFrom Westminster to Washington DC -
OL,19,Four political experts are across all
OL,20,Fthe latest key talking points. Listen
OL,21,Fto the latest episode below...
